      5: 'Creative intelligence and past life merit are the channels of recovery and resolution. This is a deeply positive sign in the context of health — the 5th house is the natural negation of disease in KP (it is the twelfth from the sixth). Illness has a natural resolution. Recovery is indicated. Creative thinking and inner wisdom help overcome adversity.',

